      "h2": "Booking a seaside hotel",
      "html": "<ul><li><strong>Sea view or not?</strong> Check the room type: sea-view rooms usually cost more.</li>\n<li><strong>Summer books up early.</strong> School holidays and bank holidays are the busiest times on the coast.</li>\n<li><strong>Try shoulder season.</strong> Spring and autumn can bring lower prices and quieter beaches.</li>\n<li><strong>Parking.</strong> Small harbour towns often have limited parking, so check what the hotel offers.</li></ul>"
    }
  ],
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "When is the cheapest time for a UK seaside break?",
      "a": "Outside school holidays and bank holidays, prices are often lower, especially midweek. Compare a few different dates to see the difference."
